  "limits": "One owned kind cluster with real Flux. The parent layout is made by labelling the owners as managed by a suspended parent Kustomization, not by a real flux bootstrap. Checks which source each surface names and the owner map list reports. It does not check revision, drift, freshness or health agreement, Argo CD, the plugin form, watch, bot or the TUI."
